60
05:14.310 --> 05:15.240
Stop crying.

61
06:56.510 --> 06:57.480
Who are you?

62
07:01.720 --> 07:03.280
Who are you?

63
07:13.560 --> 07:14.940
As his father, I was overcome with grief.

64
07:14.940 --> 07:18.060
I suspended court for 3 days to keep vigil for my beloved son.

65
07:18.060 --> 07:21.190
Following public opinion, I bestowed upon my fourth son

66
07:21.630 --> 07:23.830
the posthumous title of Prince Qihuai.

67
07:26.330 --> 07:27.770
In the end, a prince

68
07:28.710 --> 07:30.710
