197
16:43.580 --> 16:45.320
[List of Missing Persons]

198
16:46.550 --> 16:47.630
The Shen family?

199
16:47.670 --> 16:49.130
It's the courtyard ahead.

200
16:50.910 --> 16:52.780
[Noodles]

201
16:51.750 --> 16:52.550
Thank you.

202
16:52.630 --> 16:53.440
Okay.

203
16:56.030 --> 16:56.890
Is anyone here?

204
17:01.320 --> 17:02.480
Is anyone home?

205
17:10.720 --> 17:11.550
Meng Rui?

206
17:12.960 --> 17:13.920
Why is it you?

207
17:14.310 --> 17:15.270
This is my house.

208
17:18.680 --> 17:19.740
This is your house?

209
17:25.960 --> 17:27.920
Of course I know this is your house.

210
17:28.270 --> 17:29.800
I came here looking for you.

211
17:30.030 --> 17:30.880
I thought

212
17:31.440 --> 17:33.240
the one opening the door would be

213
17:33.310 --> 17:34.510
a servant or maid.

214
17:34.640 --> 17:36.270
How did you find my house?

215
17:39.110 --> 17:40.590
Didn't the Chief ask Yan and the others

216
17:40.590 --> 17:41.790
to escort you back?

217
17:42.160 --> 17:43.070
I asked them.

218
17:44.270 --> 17:45.350
No one in the bureau knows

219
17:45.350 --> 17:46.270
my address.

220
17:52.440 --> 17:53.270
I admit,

221
17:53.680 --> 17:55.960
I followed you that day.

222
17:56.310 --> 17:57.830
With my lightness skill,

223
17:57.920 --> 17:59.270
following you here

224
17:59.720 --> 18:01.270
was a piece of cake.

225
18:07.270 --> 18:08.440
Didn't you say

226
18:09.090 --> 18:11.810
you've been homeless since you were 11

227
18:11.920 --> 18:13.380
and studied under Dao Yin?

228
18:13.920 --> 18:14.830
I didn't expect

229
18:15.270 --> 18:17.070
that you'd own such an old house

230
18:17.350 --> 18:18.830
here in Tianhuang City.

231
18:19.310 --> 18:20.030
Why haven't I

232
18:20.030 --> 18:21.640
heard you mention it before?

233
18:22.030 --> 18:22.880
Or is it

234
18:23.830 --> 18:26.000
that this house is...

235
18:26.000 --> 18:26.720
Meng Rui.

236
18:26.910 --> 18:28.520
Meng Rui! Meng Rui!

237
18:34.070 --> 18:36.550
My parents must be waiting for me!

238
18:36.550 --> 18:37.590
And my brother!

239
18:37.640 --> 18:39.270
He must be anxiously waiting for me

240
18:39.270 --> 18:40.640
to fly kites together!

241
18:45.290 --> 18:47.440
Shen Jing'an, 11 years old.

242
18:48.550 --> 18:50.940
Shen Lan, 8 years old.

243
19:44.550 --> 19:45.350
Yan'er.

244
19:51.510 --> 19:53.440
So beautiful! It's awesome!

245
19:53.880 --> 19:54.920
Awesome!

246
19:54.920 --> 19:58.070
-Father made me a grasshopper! -Slow down, Fourth Prince.

247
19:58.070 --> 20:00.350
Father made me a grasshopper!

248
20:00.350 --> 20:02.440
The grasshopper Father made me

249
20:02.550 --> 20:05.070
is the most beautiful in the world!

250
20:06.550 --> 20:07.350
Father,

251
20:07.350 --> 20:09.480
will you make more for me in the future?

252
20:09.790 --> 20:10.790
I will weave a hundred grasshoppers

253
20:10.790 --> 20:12.440
for you, Yan'er.

254
20:12.750 --> 20:14.310
Why a hundred?

255
20:14.310 --> 20:17.590
Because I hope you

256
20:17.800 --> 20:19.460
can live a long life.

257
20:21.640 --> 20:22.830
But Father,

258
20:23.100 --> 20:24.310
what would you do

259
20:24.310 --> 20:25.680
if I die

260
20:25.680 --> 20:26.790
one day?

261
20:27.220 --> 20:28.150
Nonsense.

262
20:35.440 --> 20:36.480
My Yan'er

263
20:36.680 --> 20:38.480
will surely live a long life

264
20:39.240 --> 20:40.530
and become the most outstanding emperor

265
20:40.530 --> 20:42.050
of our Great Shi Dynasty.

266
21:14.820 --> 21:18.030
[Shen]

267
21:21.750 --> 21:23.270
If you are Shen Lan,

268
21:24.110 --> 21:25.030
then I guess

269
21:27.680 --> 21:30.160
your brother Shen Jing'an is still alive.

270
21:31.470 --> 21:32.750
Bearing a blood feud,

271
21:33.480 --> 21:34.790
he changed his name.

272
21:36.160 --> 21:38.240
Maybe he even became a constable.

273
21:50.350 --> 21:51.680
I'll make a bet with you.

274
21:54.010 --> 21:56.070
He must be waiting for you to come home

275
21:57.540 --> 21:59.150
to fly kites together.

276
22:26.440 --> 22:27.500
As the saying goes,

277
22:27.680 --> 22:30.030
it takes a hundred days to recover from a bone injury.

278
22:30.030 --> 22:33.880
Not to mention your injury is quite serious.

279
22:36.350 --> 22:38.270
Mr. Meng, in the future,

280
22:39.070 --> 22:41.000
we will be neighbors.

281
22:41.440 --> 22:42.440
You are welcome

282
22:43.270 --> 22:44.960
to visit me regularly.

283
22:45.640 --> 22:46.570
What did you say?

284
22:49.110 --> 22:50.070
This house...

285
22:50.830 --> 22:53.070
I bargained it down to 240 taels.

286
22:53.790 --> 22:55.680
They said that since I wanted to move in overnight,

287
22:55.680 --> 22:57.280
I had to add another 10 taels.

288
22:57.790 --> 22:58.590
I don't know

289
22:58.590 --> 22:59.880
if spending these 250 taels of silver

290
22:59.880 --> 23:00.750
was considered

291
23:01.110 --> 23:02.110
expensive or not.

292
23:07.920 --> 23:09.050
I have a gift for you.

293
23:17.450 --> 23:19.580
Shen Lan, let's see

294
23:19.890 --> 23:21.050
who wins this bet.

295
23:21.080 --> 23:22.450
You, or me.

296
23:23.400 --> 23:24.760
I can only try.

297
23:34.710 --> 23:36.590
Brother, you're flying it so high.

298
23:36.590 --> 23:37.350
Brother,

299
23:37.350 --> 23:39.110
can you fly it a bit higher?

300
23:39.110 --> 23:39.920
Okay!

301
24:14.220 --> 24:15.250
It seems

302
24:16.480 --> 24:18.100
my guess was right.

303
24:18.500 --> 24:20.000
Shen Jing'an has never

304
24:20.000 --> 24:20.790
forgotten

305
24:21.400 --> 24:23.320
the promise with his brother.

306
24:26.790 --> 24:27.920
The deeper the love,

307
24:28.640 --> 24:30.110
the deeper the pain.

308
24:52.110 --> 24:52.920
Meng Rui,

309
24:54.640 --> 24:55.790
don't mind

310
24:55.960 --> 24:57.000
the kite.

311
24:57.640 --> 24:59.640
I just wanted to give my new neighbor

312
24:59.640 --> 25:00.790
a little gift.

313
25:05.350 --> 25:06.880
Let's get down to business.

314
25:07.400 --> 25:08.590
I promised

315
25:08.960 --> 25:11.350
to tell you the situation in the bureau.

316
25:12.030 --> 25:13.200
The case of the demon

317
25:13.400 --> 25:15.000
has made no progress so far.

318
25:15.550 --> 25:17.210
Lou Tianming's wanted poster

319
25:17.550 --> 25:20.160
has also been sent to all prefectures and counties.

320
25:20.160 --> 25:21.490
You don't need to worry.

321
25:28.110 --> 25:28.920
By the way,

322
25:29.830 --> 25:31.090
there is one more thing

323
25:31.720 --> 25:34.310
that is crucial to the overall situation.

324
25:34.350 --> 25:37.000
Although the Chief repeatedly told me

325
25:37.160 --> 25:38.480
not to tell you yet,

326
25:38.750 --> 25:40.790
I think

327
25:42.310 --> 25:43.960
I should still let you know.

328
25:46.790 --> 25:47.590
Come in.

329
25:50.830 --> 25:51.720
When will you change your habit

330
25:51.720 --> 25:53.750
of always bringing up the Chief

331
25:53.960 --> 25:55.160
at every turn?

332
26:01.000 --> 26:02.350
What's on your back?

333
26:05.470 --> 26:07.330
The Kui Wood Wolf constellation.

334
26:07.590 --> 26:08.400
Ever since Dao Yin

335
26:08.400 --> 26:09.720
taught me the Severe-Cold Sword technique,

336
26:09.720 --> 26:10.750
I've had this.

337
26:11.310 --> 26:13.570
It appears whenever I channel my energy.

338
26:17.830 --> 26:19.440
I didn't expect this technique

339
26:19.440 --> 26:20.790
to be so profound.

340
26:22.310 --> 26:24.170
The Severe-Cold Sword technique

341
26:24.240 --> 26:25.700
is indeed extraordinary.

342
26:30.030 --> 26:31.160
You and Dao Yin...

343
26:31.790 --> 26:32.960
A beggar

344
26:33.160 --> 26:34.200
and a wanderer

345
26:35.160 --> 26:36.400
actually developed

346
26:36.750 --> 26:38.510
such a master-disciple bond.

347
26:39.120 --> 26:40.800
What a deep destiny.

348
26:49.510 --> 26:50.310
Meng Rui,

349
26:52.000 --> 26:52.610
why did you

350
26:52.640 --> 26:54.400
want to learn the Severe-Cold Sword technique?

351
26:54.400 --> 26:55.260
Could it be that

352
26:56.200 --> 26:58.060
you have some deep-seated hatred

353
26:58.350 --> 26:59.750
and need peerless martial arts

354
26:59.750 --> 27:01.160
to take revenge?

355
27:20.200 --> 27:21.350
Nice drawing.

356
27:23.350 --> 27:24.750
But what is this you drew?

357
27:25.750 --> 27:27.400
This is the tattoo I saw

358
27:27.590 --> 27:28.720
on the demon's nape.

359
27:29.720 --> 27:30.510
Since

360
27:31.350 --> 27:33.350
they tattooed it on their bodies,

361
27:33.750 --> 27:34.720
it means

362
27:35.720 --> 27:36.920
this thing is crucial

363
27:37.350 --> 27:39.400
to them.

364
27:43.270 --> 27:44.070
Meng Rui,

365
27:45.640 --> 27:47.170
have you ever thought about

366
27:47.550 --> 27:48.240
investigating

367
27:48.240 --> 27:49.720
the origin of this bug?

368
27:49.960 --> 27:50.960
I was just planning

369
27:50.960 --> 27:53.560
to go to Tianshu Pavilion to check it out later.

370
27:56.000 --> 27:58.350
Why would Tianshu Pavilion know anything about this?

371
27:58.350 --> 28:00.330
For weird things like this,

372
28:00.550 --> 28:02.590
you have to rely on unorthodox methods

373
28:02.590 --> 28:03.480
to ask around.

374
28:08.750 --> 28:09.880
Are you interested?

375
28:10.310 --> 28:11.680
I'll take you to a place

376
28:12.000 --> 28:13.400
to help you investigate.

377
28:22.000 --> 28:23.730
This is the Underworld Market?

378
28:24.680 --> 28:25.480
That's right.

379
28:26.240 --> 28:28.040
This is the largest black market

380
28:28.140 --> 28:29.680
in Great Shi.

381
28:30.830 --> 28:32.750
The Divine Constable Bureau has tried to raid it many times,

382
28:32.750 --> 28:34.350
but could never find a way in.

383
28:36.590 --> 28:39.030
I remember when you first joined the Divine Constable Bureau,

384
28:39.030 --> 28:41.960
you arrested many merchants from the Underworld Market.

385
28:41.960 --> 28:44.360
What is your relationship with this place?

386
28:44.960 --> 28:46.220
Lord Constable Ghost,

387
28:46.790 --> 28:47.920
don't forget.

388
28:48.350 --> 28:49.880
Besides being a constable,

389
28:50.240 --> 28:51.720
I am also a merchant.

390
28:52.400 --> 28:53.550
As a merchant,

391
28:54.200 --> 28:55.030
it's natural to have some

392
28:55.030 --> 28:56.200
connections.

393
28:56.640 --> 28:58.900
It's not surprising that I have dealings

394
28:59.350 --> 29:00.950
with the Underworld Market.

395
29:01.000 --> 29:01.830
Let's go.

396
29:19.920 --> 29:21.050
Why are you running?

397
29:22.110 --> 29:23.000
Don't worry.

398
29:23.720 --> 29:24.880
The one who came here today

399
29:24.880 --> 29:26.350
is not Lord Constable Ghost,

400
29:26.350 --> 29:27.310
but my friend.

401
29:29.480 --> 29:30.750
We are here to ask you

402
29:30.880 --> 29:32.310
about something.

403
29:34.960 --> 29:36.000
I really don't know

404
29:36.000 --> 29:37.480
where your master is.

405
29:46.160 --> 29:47.920
Have you seen this?

406
29:52.330 --> 29:53.390
The usual rules.

407
29:57.510 --> 29:58.370
Is that enough?

408
29:58.640 --> 30:00.240
Tell us everything you know.

409
30:04.750 --> 30:05.640
Mr. Meng...

410
30:08.240 --> 30:11.290
Have you ever heard of the Five Wonders of Liluo?

411
30:11.670 --> 30:13.130
The Five Wonders of Liluo?

412
30:14.630 --> 30:16.710
This insect is called Chiying,

413
30:16.830 --> 30:19.240
one of the Five Wonders of Liluo.

414
30:19.650 --> 30:21.200
In our line of work,

415
30:21.310 --> 30:24.110
we often have to search around for

416
30:24.310 --> 30:28.370
snakes, insects, and poisonous plants to use as medicinal ingredients.

417
30:28.790 --> 30:29.590
Rumor has it

418
30:30.410 --> 30:31.280
that Chiying

419
30:31.310 --> 30:33.510
loves to gather around graves.

420
30:34.440 --> 30:36.000
Someone once saw it

421
30:36.680 --> 30:38.010
while gathering herbs.

422
30:38.160 --> 30:38.960
Where?

423
30:39.830 --> 30:40.920
Where?

424
30:41.830 --> 30:43.310
When people get old,

425
30:44.110 --> 30:45.710
they really become useless.

426
30:47.310 --> 30:48.240
Useless...

427
30:50.160 --> 30:50.960
Speak.

428
30:57.720 --> 30:58.880
I remember now.

429
31:00.240 --> 31:03.720
It was found in Mingling County, Qingzhou.

430
31:03.960 --> 31:04.920
There's one person here

431
31:04.920 --> 31:05.920
who isn't marked.

432
31:05.930 --> 31:07.940
[Ministry of War Roster] [Su Wei]

433
31:06.310 --> 31:08.170
Could this person still be alive?

434
31:08.270 --> 31:09.240
This person

435
31:09.240 --> 31:11.110
went to Mingling County in Qingzhou many years ago

436
31:11.110 --> 31:12.970
and disappeared without a trace.

437
31:13.070 --> 31:14.110
This Chiying insect

438
31:14.110 --> 31:15.790
is no ordinary bug.

439
31:16.110 --> 31:18.560
Anyone who sees it is terrified.

440
31:18.880 --> 31:19.680
However,

441
31:20.110 --> 31:22.440
that's all in the past.

442
31:22.720 --> 31:23.880
Later on,

443
31:23.880 --> 31:25.440
it disappeared completely.

444
31:25.440 --> 31:27.110
Since it is one of the Five Wonders of Liluo,

445
31:27.110 --> 31:28.370
what makes it a wonder?

446
31:29.640 --> 31:31.440
Its wonder lies in its poison.

447
31:32.030 --> 31:33.550
If a hundred of them bite the body

448
31:33.550 --> 31:34.830
and the poison enters the marrow,

449
31:34.830 --> 31:36.880
it can turn a person into a demon.

450
31:37.350 --> 31:38.610
The poisoned person's

451
31:38.640 --> 31:41.240
physical capabilities will increase severalfold,

452
31:41.240 --> 31:42.900
with a body of the netherworld

453
31:43.110 --> 31:44.720
and the soul of a beast.

454
31:45.960 --> 31:47.070
In that case,

455
31:47.920 --> 31:49.720
Liluo's Dark Night is using this method

456
31:49.720 --> 31:51.750
to turn living people into demonic suicide squads

457
31:51.750 --> 31:52.830
for its use.

458
31:53.480 --> 31:54.480
No wonder those demons

459
31:54.480 --> 31:56.000
were impossible to kill.

460
31:56.550 --> 31:58.590
Their bodies have mutated.

461
31:59.110 --> 32:00.510
Half human, half demon.

462
32:01.240 --> 32:02.920
What an evil practice.

463
32:05.960 --> 32:07.000
You mentioned

464
32:07.440 --> 32:08.900
the Five Wonders of Liluo.

465
32:09.240 --> 32:10.700
Besides the Chiying bugs,

466
32:11.160 --> 32:12.690
what are the other wonders?

467
32:13.240 --> 32:14.770
You asked the right person.

468
32:18.160 --> 32:19.290
Trying to snatch it?

469
32:21.440 --> 32:22.240
Speak.

470
32:23.240 --> 32:24.640
Chiying bugs light the fire,

471
32:24.640 --> 32:26.400
eroding bones to spawn demons.

472
32:27.240 --> 32:28.240
The Chiying bugs.

473
32:28.730 --> 32:30.030
Luo flowers condense into jade,

474
32:30.030 --> 32:31.830
turning white hair black again.

475
32:32.070 --> 32:34.400
Tianmoluo, the fruit of immortality.

476
32:35.310 --> 32:36.880
Puppets pulled by moss threads,

477
32:36.880 --> 32:38.680
having neither tears nor heart.

478
32:40.510 --> 32:41.510
Puppetry.

479
32:42.030 --> 32:43.680
The moon's reflection turns into the flower in the mirror,

480
32:43.680 --> 32:45.510
replacing old bones with new faces.

481
32:45.510 --> 32:46.960
The Canglang tide boils,

482
32:46.960 --> 32:49.420
and the Eight Wastelands breathe together.

483
32:52.640 --> 32:53.880
What are these two?

484
32:53.900 --> 32:55.450
I don't know about that.

485
32:55.510 --> 32:56.860
That's all

486
32:56.930 --> 32:58.190
I know.

487
33:00.750 --> 33:02.610
Liluo actually has 5 ultimate secret arts.

488
33:02.610 --> 33:03.920
They're carefully planning

489
33:03.920 --> 33:06.380
to use these evil arts to revive their reign.

490
33:06.550 --> 33:07.810
Great Shi is in danger.

491
33:07.880 --> 33:10.110
You are quite concerned about the country and the people.

492
33:10.110 --> 33:11.680
I thought Lord Constable Ghost

493
33:11.680 --> 33:14.280
only cared about catching and killing people.

494
33:14.510 --> 33:15.310
Don't worry.

495
33:15.550 --> 33:16.110
If we can

496
33:16.110 --> 33:17.840
get a hold of this information,

497
33:17.930 --> 33:20.450
the Chief and the one on the dragon throne

498
33:20.490 --> 33:21.820
must have found out too.

499
33:29.030 --> 33:30.030
It's just that...

500
33:30.550 --> 33:33.080
We are in the open, and the enemy is in the dark.

501
33:33.750 --> 33:34.880
It's hard for us to find

502
33:34.880 --> 33:36.110
their traces.

503
33:36.510 --> 33:38.160
How would we know if we don't try?

504
33:38.160 --> 33:39.070
Well said.

505
33:39.750 --> 33:41.810
As expected of Lord Constable Ghost.

506
33:42.480 --> 33:43.510
Old Geezer said

507
33:43.510 --> 33:45.640
the last place the Chiying bugs appeared

508
33:45.640 --> 33:47.440
was Mingling County, Qingzhou.

509
33:47.650 --> 33:48.450
How about it?

510
33:48.750 --> 33:49.880
Are you interested

511
33:50.000 --> 33:51.200
in going together?

512
33:58.920 --> 34:01.380
You're not thinking of going alone, are you?

513
34:02.000 --> 34:02.680
If I take you,

514
34:02.680 --> 34:03.920
I have to ask the Chief for orders

515
34:03.920 --> 34:05.270
and treat it as official business.

516
34:05.270 --> 34:06.750
I haven't recovered from my injuries yet.

517
34:06.750 --> 34:08.670
Do you think the Chief would agree?

518
34:08.670 --> 34:09.840
Let me tell you,

519
34:09.960 --> 34:11.510
if you don't take me,

520
34:11.750 --> 34:13.630
I'll report to the Chief

521
34:13.710 --> 34:15.300
that you are investigating privately

522
34:15.300 --> 34:16.480
and acting without authorization.

523
34:16.480 --> 34:17.540
When that happens,

524
34:17.710 --> 34:18.880
the Chief will never

525
34:18.880 --> 34:20.190
dispatch you there.

526
34:20.230 --> 34:21.320
Think it through.

527
34:24.469 --> 34:25.550
Su Wei...

528
34:30.510 --> 34:31.360
Li Qingyang!

529
34:32.949 --> 34:35.150
[Star-Gathering Pavilion]

530
34:41.770 --> 34:43.260
[Ministry of War Roster] [Su Wei]

531
34:56.150 --> 34:58.480
Going to Mingling County to find someone?

532
34:59.480 --> 35:01.610
I thought you were going to catch bugs.

533
35:04.670 --> 35:05.760
In a sea of people,

534
35:05.960 --> 35:08.510
do you think it's easier to find a person

535
35:08.880 --> 35:10.320
or a bug?

536
35:10.320 --> 35:11.150
Save it.

537
35:12.150 --> 35:14.350
With your current physical condition,

538
35:14.360 --> 35:17.490
it's a question whether you'll even survive the search.

539
35:20.550 --> 35:21.360
Tell me,

540
35:22.670 --> 35:23.630
even if

541
35:24.360 --> 35:25.510
I find this Su Wei

542
35:25.510 --> 35:26.360
from back then

543
35:26.710 --> 35:29.440
and force him to tell everything about what happened,

544
35:29.440 --> 35:30.230
will Father

545
35:31.280 --> 35:32.880
release my eldest brother?

546
35:34.670 --> 35:35.530
My disciple...

547
35:36.510 --> 35:37.400
Actually, you already

548
35:37.400 --> 35:38.670
know the answer,

549
35:39.510 --> 35:40.360
don't you?

550
35:46.150 --> 35:47.750
You already know the answer.

551
35:53.110 --> 35:55.050
[Su Wei]

552
35:55.610 --> 35:57.280
[Divine Constable Bureau]

553
35:56.000 --> 35:57.510
In Mingling County, Qingzhou,

554
35:57.510 --> 36:00.320
a green-haired demon suddenly appeared on Mount Fuyao.

555
36:00.320 --> 36:02.570
Its appearance is terrifying, and its movements are mysterious.

556
36:02.570 --> 36:03.880
It digs up graves, unearths corpses,

557
36:03.880 --> 36:05.610
picks bones, and eats carrion.

558
36:06.920 --> 36:08.120
Green-haired demon.

559
36:09.110 --> 36:10.510
The magistrate of Mingling County

560
36:10.510 --> 36:12.070
is quite good at naming things.

561
36:12.070 --> 36:12.630
Previously,

562
36:12.630 --> 36:14.510
similar cases had been reported.

563
36:14.880 --> 36:16.030
They were mostly

564
36:16.030 --> 36:17.150
baseless rumors

565
36:17.280 --> 36:18.440
and nonsense from people

566
36:18.440 --> 36:19.640
scaring themselves.

567
36:19.970 --> 36:20.960
Let the local officials

568
36:20.960 --> 36:22.360
investigate it further.

569
36:25.320 --> 36:26.280
Chief,

570
36:26.510 --> 36:27.920
please look closely.

571
36:28.110 --> 36:29.960
This case is very uncanny

572
36:30.070 --> 36:31.470
and by no means ordinary.

573
36:31.590 --> 36:32.990
What's uncanny about it?

574
36:33.110 --> 36:34.710
A demon with green hair?

575
36:42.860 --> 36:44.190
Reporting to the Chief,

576
36:44.760 --> 36:46.760
I asked Constable Li

577
36:46.760 --> 36:47.960
to bring up this case.

578
36:48.480 --> 36:51.340
But investigating the case is not the main purpose.

579
36:51.670 --> 36:52.670
Then what is it?

580
36:53.070 --> 36:53.880
It's...

581
36:55.840 --> 36:56.840
To recuperate.

582
36:58.760 --> 37:00.090
You may not know, Chief.

583
37:00.400 --> 37:01.920
Since I was injured,

584
37:02.470 --> 37:04.320
I've been deeply troubled and restless.

585
37:04.320 --> 37:05.250
Mingling County

586
37:05.400 --> 37:07.070
is my ancestral home.

587
37:07.280 --> 37:09.150
For some reason, I suddenly...

588
37:10.550 --> 37:12.790
felt a bit homesick.

589
37:14.150 --> 37:15.320
I didn't know that.

590
37:16.110 --> 37:18.570
In that case, your health takes precedence.

591
37:18.670 --> 37:19.760
Take your time there.

592
37:19.760 --> 37:20.890
Relax and rest well.

593
37:21.480 --> 37:23.210
As for the green-haired demon,

594
37:23.760 --> 37:25.560
leave it to the local officials.

595
37:26.000 --> 37:27.000
Thank you, Chief.

596
37:28.320 --> 37:29.510
Then I'll go too.

597
37:31.320 --> 37:32.110
Li Qingyang.

598
37:32.880 --> 37:33.550
Yes.

599
37:33.550 --> 37:34.510
Recently, the Ministry of Justice

600
37:34.510 --> 37:36.550
is going to shut down some underground banks.

601
37:36.550 --> 37:38.070
Assist them on the side.

602
37:38.360 --> 37:39.480
You don't need to take the lead,

603
37:39.480 --> 37:40.810
but you need to be there.

604
37:40.960 --> 37:42.000
As a newly appointed Divine Constable,

605
37:42.000 --> 37:42.800
this task

606
37:42.800 --> 37:44.280
is perfect for you.

607
37:44.400 --> 37:44.960
But...

608
37:44.960 --> 37:45.960
It's settled.

609
37:46.190 --> 37:47.110
You may all leave.

610
37:47.110 --> 37:48.150
Chief...

611
37:55.000 --> 37:56.000
Chief.

612
37:56.000 --> 37:57.360
Constable Ghost hasn't fully recovered yet.

613
37:57.360 --> 37:58.510
I am willing to accompany him

614
37:58.510 --> 38:00.170
to facilitate his treatment.

615
38:01.710 --> 38:02.510
Alright.

616
38:06.710 --> 38:07.510
Who else?

617
38:07.800 --> 38:09.400
Come in and say it all at once.

618
38:13.510 --> 38:14.510
Chief.

619
38:14.760 --> 38:15.550
What is it?

620
38:15.880 --> 38:17.280
Have you forgotten, Chief?

621
38:17.280 --> 38:18.960
While Mr. Meng has been recovering,

622
38:18.960 --> 38:19.920
all the fieldwork cases

623
38:19.920 --> 38:21.320
have fallen on me alone.

624
38:21.320 --> 38:22.440
Didn't you promise

625
38:22.590 --> 38:23.880
that after this matter,

626
38:23.880 --> 38:25.610
you would give me some time off?

627
38:27.510 --> 38:28.880
That is true.

628
38:28.880 --> 38:30.210
I forgot when I got busy.

629
38:30.360 --> 38:32.510
Then I grant you half a month's leave.

630
38:33.190 --> 38:34.480
Thank you, Chief.

631
38:47.760 --> 38:49.360
So I'm the only one left.

632
40:00.760 --> 40:03.890
Congratulations on your successful mutation, My Lord.

633
40:06.360 --> 40:07.760
What about the others?

634
40:07.970 --> 40:09.360
My Lord, your talent is extraordinary.

635
40:09.360 --> 40:10.800
How can mere people compare?

636
40:10.800 --> 40:12.920
The current success rate is less than ten percent.

637
40:12.920 --> 40:14.880
And even those who have mutated

638
40:14.880 --> 40:16.280
may experience

639
40:16.360 --> 40:17.480
sudden death.

640
40:20.760 --> 40:22.480
Go capture more people...

641
40:25.580 --> 40:27.230
Go capture more people.

642
40:27.710 --> 40:28.850
I want people.

643
40:29.320 --> 40:30.360
I want demons!

644
40:30.880 --> 40:32.960
Only a sufficiently powerful army

645
40:33.360 --> 40:35.360
can be invincible!

646
40:36.550 --> 40:37.360
Yes.
